# Sonu-One Theme Development Rules

This repository contains specific guidelines and styling initiatives that must be followed when modifying or creating sections, blocks, templates, and styles.

---

## 1. Global Typography Settings Initiative (Sonu Typography)
To ensure absolute layout flexibility without bloating custom styles, all text selectors (headings, subheadings, role labels, body text, buttons) must support both **standard typography presets** and a **Custom** typography mode.

### Schema Requirements:
Every typography preset selector must use the following standard schema options:
```json
{
  "type": "select",
  "id": "heading_style",
  "label": "Heading Style",
  "options": [
    { "value": "h1", "label": "H1" },
    { "value": "h2", "label": "H2" },
    { "value": "h3", "label": "H3" },
    { "value": "h4", "label": "H4" },
    { "value": "h5", "label": "H5" },
    { "value": "h6", "label": "H6" },
    { "value": "p", "label": "Paragraph (P)" },
    { "value": "custom", "label": "Custom" }
  ],
  "default": "h2"
}
```

If a text element supports a typography preset selector, it **must** also include schema settings for individual properties prefixed with the selector's `id`:
```json
[
  {
    "type": "range",
    "id": "heading_style_font_size_desktop",
    "label": "Heading Custom Size (Desktop)",
    "min": 10,
    "max": 100,
    "step": 1,
    "unit": "px",
    "default": 32
  },
  {
    "type": "range",
    "id": "heading_style_font_size_mobile",
    "label": "Heading Custom Size (Mobile)",
    "min": 10,
    "max": 100,
    "step": 1,
    "unit": "px",
    "default": 24
  },
  {
    "type": "select",
    "id": "heading_style_font_weight",
    "label": "Heading Custom Font Weight",
    "options": [
      { "value": "300", "label": "Light" },
      { "value": "400", "label": "Regular" },
      { "value": "500", "label": "Medium" },
      { "value": "600", "label": "Semi-bold" },
      { "value": "700", "label": "Bold" }
    ],
    "default": "400"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "heading_style_line_height",
    "label": "Heading Custom Line Height",
    "default": "1.2"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "heading_style_letter_spacing",
    "label": "Heading Custom Letter Spacing (em / %)",
    "default": "0"
  },
  {
    "type": "select",
    "id": "heading_style_text_transform",
    "label": "Heading Custom Text Transform",
